        <briefdescription>
<para>Verify profiled cooperative chunk durations against scheduler peer budgets. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Scans all profiled tasks with <computeroutput>step_count &gt; 0</computeroutput> up to <computeroutput>min(mgr-&gt;count, sched-&gt;task_count)</computeroutput>, counting every task whose <computeroutput>max_yield_us</computeroutput> exceeds <computeroutput><ref refid="syn__task__profile_8h_1a135234b1743c7e637d8df354f838a01e" kindref="member">syn_task_profile_task_budget_us()</ref></computeroutput>. Populates <computeroutput>worst_out</computeroutput> (when non-NULL) with the violation having the largest overrun (<computeroutput>max_yield_us - budget_us</computeroutput>).</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>mgr</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Initialized task profile manager. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>sched</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Scheduler instance whose tasks were profiled. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>out_violations</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Output receiving total number of budget-violating tasks. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>worst_out</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Optional output receiving the worst violation (zeroed if 0). </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>SYN_OK on success, or SYN_INVALID_PARAM on NULL required arguments. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
