    <briefdescription>
<para>Opt-In Task Execution, CPU Jitter &amp; Cooperative Chunk-Budget Profiler. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Provides opt-in execution duration, maximum yield latency, CPU % utilization tracking, and cooperative starvation-budget verification for protothread tasks. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
